<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-11T15:34:05.767Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:34:05 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian drones have attacked Eritrean forces that are supporting Tigrayan rebels, while Eritrean troops have entered Ethiopian territory, prompting both sides to request UN deterrence or intervention. The fighting now spans Tigray, Amhara and the border area, and Ethiopia has warned Eritrea that it will defend itself against the incursions. Both governments accuse each other of provoking a wider war as Tigrayan rebels retreat. The UN chief has expressed grave concern about the renewed fighting in northern Ethiopia. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/eritrean-troops-in-ethiopia-raise-fears-of-a-regional-war/a-79615065?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQnBha3VpVVVrYTg2Wi1WLVJUQjRPNzNyaG1EYklBZFZuQ1A2T0hxRDFTMWJycnZjVm0zc2Q3dXR1OVBHdWh3elVBMHhxLS14RU9fcVJ4WkdqUGVZd05iVHJYU3BpcmRnbTlRdkZkcXpKX2pYZ0hIS00yOG0yMl9LaXBTSjVnaG9LQmhmTGp3dVRfbXFFQ1RtTTQ2NS10b3c5WkdwRmFHcklDdmxOSlNkT3hYS0dRRGZBM0JpWWtB0gG-AUFVX3lxTE9XT2JMLVBaekkxTy1OQ0w4R2d0bnk4SF85RlBwNDMzSE1BN1M5TmZaUVRsSFJsaE1BYjBmTnZ1TVRieUVPbVZIYmRNbHZzbmRsVXJ2cExLUVBxV2p4cnB0a3BJUHctbVc5bWJHRUQ1ZWgyNGFmZ0tCMGs2eUZhbWhwd2FtVWVnV2ZwbDhEcjRTRGlGWDZBMTBwRWtwTFBxNVd4Y3NzdS1pUGdfcE80b0lNb2hKVFFMXzFRVHdpN2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPTnphMnlRVXBZZlZVeTJadUF2N0hWYVlFdjFFS0lYZENfMFFtc2pRejFvX0xXZFY5LUNPOGc5bWdOU0d6RmhZS3RXVi1KMlBzOHFMX1dvUmpWRDFVdThsTW1majNiSnZXdDM1ekpqYmhNUHpjNnhnOHJ6eGx1aTNyUzJPV2Y5X05